{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/424512-vampire-character-questionnaire","id":424512,"title":"Vampire Character Questionnaire","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-01T14:24:18-08:00","id":424512,"title":"Vampire Character Questionnaire","content":"Inspired by the work of our own Baron Samedi and a fellow on the Eclipse Phase forums, I decided to make a character questionnaire to use for my future vampire games. I wanted to share it here for anyone else that might care to use it, and also to get your feedback on it. Do you guys think it could be better organized? Do you object to any of the questions on the questionnaire? Did I miss anything that you guys think would be important to include in there?<br /> <br /> Finally, if anyone wants to copy the document and fill it in, please do. Any and all feedback is appreciated, once again special thanks to Baron Samedi for inspiring me to make this.<br /> <br /> Sample character also included, if you're looking for ideas on formatting your answers.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NJMe5aXUuXE7i-c1frkV-q5x-MA4q81RzCJVfk68hBA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sample Character: Marian The Red</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FbkoPawyDeIXGPJerZNSvn3-oU83uTGm2wJbkc5LzUY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire Character Questionnaire</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":159,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","user":"Leetsepeak","date":". 03-04-2015, 02:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T16:07:14-08:00","id":424626,"title":"","content":"Oh, this is some good stuff. I'm going to run some characters through this to help flesh them out a bit.<br /> <br /> Think you could make something like this for Werewolf, or Changeling? Or one of the others?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T16:16:53-08:00","id":424634,"title":"","content":"I second both of Mr. or Ms. Aiden's motions. Well done!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T16:19:26-08:00","id":424636,"title":"","content":"It really predicates on my learning more about said splats. I'm hoping to finally have a good handle on Werewolf when its 2nd edition comes out. The only other splats I've played/read enough of to be really familiar with are Mage and Demon. If people are looking for those, I could try to whip something up for them.<br /> <br /> I wan