on__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It really predicates on my learning more about said splats. I'm hoping to finally have a good handle on Werewolf when its 2nd edition comes out. The only other splats I've played/read enough of to be really familiar with are Mage and Demon. If people are looking for those, I could try to whip something up for them.<br /> <br /> I want to learn about Changeling, but I'm not sure if I should wait for its 2nd edition or not.<br /> <br /> Any formatting things you like or don't like? Any questions you feel should be added? Please let me know.</div> </div> </div> </div>I second Zealous' suggestion.<br /> <br /> But hey, some Mage or Demon wouldn't hurt either while we wait for the goodness that is Werewolf 2e to finally come out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-02T00:05:30-08:00","id":424941,"title":"","content":"Updated it with two new questions, one about Disciplines, and the other is an embarassing hole in the questionnaire: Your Touchstone.<br /> <br /> I'm still working on an example one, for a character I hope to play in a <i>Requiem for Regina </i>game. If anyone is working on one for modern nights, I'm sure that would be valuable, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":159,"user_link":"https: